IF @mode != "refine"
    RETURN "PR refinement was not selected."

USE ../../references/be-human.md AS writing_guidance
USE ../../references/technical-summary.md#summary-content AS summary_rules

DO Read @ticket_path and @pr_path together. Return an object with saved_pr and
    the exact unrequested sections that must be preserved. AS documents

DO Check branch and HEAD before reusing implementation evidence. Inspect
    committed changes only for material gaps. Do not fetch, choose a target, or
    run a readiness pass. Return the evidence and observed checks. AS evidence

DO Build an in-memory draft from @documents.saved_pr, @request, @evidence,
    @writing_guidance, and @summary_rules. Refine only the requested Title line
    or Description. Preserve accurate notes and unrequested sections
    byte-for-byte. Return an object with draft and unrelated_gaps. AS refinement

DO Read the first heading from @ticket_path and return only its ticket ID. AS current_ticket_id

IF @current_ticket_id != @ticket_id
    RETURN "PR refinement stopped because the active ticket changed."

DO Save @refinement.draft only to @pr_path.

PRINT Report @pr_path, @evidence, and @refinement.unrelated_gaps briefly.
